# Secluded Starforge's "{2}, {T}, Tap X untapped artifacts you control" chooses its X artifacts as the cost is paid, once
# the mana abilities have been activated (CR 601.2g-h by way of 602.2b). With X announced as 1 and no mana in the pool,
# Bot1 pays the {2} by tapping Sol Ring: a tapped permanent can't be tapped to pay a cost (CR 118.3), so Sol Ring is not
# offered as the artifact to tap, and Memnite, the only untapped one left, is tapped instead. Memnite is the target too,
# and is 2/1 until end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Secluded Starforge
Sol Ring
Island
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Secluded Starforge.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Secluded Starforge.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Secluded Starforge.Activate(Ability: Target creature; X: 1; Target: Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
! Bot1.Choose(Sol Ring)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Secluded Starforge)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Secluded Starforge.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
